  "description": "YITAMOTOR middle buster is made heavy-duty, including a durable furrower blade and 2 plow blades, Suitable for a wide range of soils and great ideal for trenching.\nFitment\nSuitable for Category 1 tractor, with 3 Point Quick Hitch.\nFeatures\nRugged and Durable\nYITAMOTOR middle buster is made of heavy-duty, high-quality carbon steel, ideal for trenching. Suitable for any season and a wide range of soils.\nCorrosion Resistant\nThe soil furrower is finished with a black powder coat and spray paint process to resist rust and reduce scratches. This means you can use it in any weather and never have to worry about your crop planting time being delayed.\nVersatility\nThis Category 1 middle buster includes a durable furrower blade and 2 plow blades, the former to open the furrow and the latter to poke away the soil, with significantly better furrowing results than other products with only one shovel.\nFit and Quick Installation\nCompatible with Cat.-1 quick hitch, you can install our product on your tractor in minutes, for your safety, professional installation is recommended.\nDimensions\nLength: 18.1inch, Width: 25.2inch, Height: 4.3inch; Weight: 50.7lbs.",
